     {
      "id": "540686",
      "longComment": "With Robinson set to miss a third contest due to an illness, Boston will again be without one of its primary center options. His absence should continue to leave more frontcourt minutes available for Neemias Queta and Luka Garza on Tuesday, with the former being in line to see the lion's share of the playing time.",
      "shortComment": "Robinson (illness) is out for Tuesday's game against Washington, Taylor Snow of the Celtics' official site reports.",
